{"about_the_game":"Scuttle Up is a punishing platformer where you play as a depressed-yet-agile crab. Your journey begins in a boring corporate office, and your mission is to escape the 9-5 and ascend to the top of a mysterious island. A prize worthy of a king crab awaits you at the top, but do you have the resolve to make it there?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How To Enjoy:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Be a crab. Awesome<br></li><li> Grab &amp; throw objects to make it look like you know what you're doing<br></li><li> Collect hidden hats, wear them, &amp; look cooler than your friends</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Remember:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> If you can't make it very far, its a skill issue; try getting good<br></li><li> You will lose faith in yourself, this game, and all of mankind<br></li><li> Prepare to suffer</li></ul><br>When you're not falling off the map, you can enjoy the interesting and stylized environment of The Island. There are little secrets hidden throughout, so make sure to look around.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Interesting levels with multiple solutions - Play your way!<br></li><li> Fully simulated day/night cycles<br></li><li> Dynamic weather effects<br></li><li> Unique moveable objects with simulated physics<br></li><li> Lovely video game water<br></li><li> and more!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3124710?t=1743878425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3124710?t=1743878425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124710/dd1e313daea9bfc78a429297449259ba28745c5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743878425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124710/dd1e313daea9bfc78a429297449259ba28745c5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743878425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conte